hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1077","Chapter on payment for campaigning, 1115 - Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Abu Salih narrated to us, he said: al-Layth narrated to me, he said: Haywah ibn Shurayh al-Kindi narrated to me, from Ibn Shufayy, from Shufayy, from Abd Allah ibn Amr ibn al-As (may Allah be pleased with them), that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: A return from campaign is like a campaign. And he said: The fighter has his reward, and the one who pays for him has his own reward and the reward of the fighter."
